This folder contains the input files for the code. 
These input files are the same as the 27th Feb 26 commit to the TwoPhase branch. 
Input files related to the manuscript:
'1AA_2Phase_code_RESTART' - allows user to restart code at particular point if it crashes.
'1AA_2Phase_FourMPD' - contains the inputs for the chemical model used in the manuscript.
'1AA_2Phase_master_input_v6' - main input file for model. 
'1AA_2Phase_SSPD_master' and '1AA_2Phase_HHJPet_master' are input files for other chemical
models which can be used with the model (see TwoPhase branch). However, they do not affect the model
run for the manuscrpt. But must be present to run model.

File last updated: 10th June 26

